// --- Events ---
//
// XPending never blocks and reports only what has arrived; XNextEvent blocks. The
// pump in window.cst uses the first and the second is what wait_xevent exposes.
// XGetEventData/XFreeEventData are the XI2 cookie pair, and the reason the ring
// copies a payload before storing it.

